[en.CHARACTER_VAPOR_TRAIL_NAME]
Vapor Trail

[en.CHARACTER_VAPOR_TRAIL_DESC]
Former Wonderbolts Academy student, one of the prides of Stratusburg. Vapor Trail grew up in a family that spoiled her excessively, which led her to decide to stay away from the spotlight and hide from the public eye. At the Wonderbolts Academy, she has always been helping her friend Sky Stinger fly, but never thought of becoming an excellent flyer herself. Fortunately, after Sky Stinger discovered the truth, Vapor Trail finally realized her potential under the persuasion of Twilight Sparkle and Rainbow Dash. Unfortunately, the dissolution of the Wonderbolts Academy brought Sky Stinger and Vapor Trail back to their hometown, where they run a small diner together. Sky Stinger’s business skills are very average, so Vapor Trail often has to, like once again, secretly take over Sky Stinger’s work of attracting customers, negotiating with suppliers, planning events, etc.
A few years ago, due to their past at the Wonderbolts Academy, their diner was willing to accept members of the “Free Stratusburg Movement” and shelter them from the Empire’s pursuit. Now, the “Free Stratusburg Movement” has achieved a partial victory, and their diner has become an important entertainment venue for the residents of Stratusburg. Business is booming.

[zh.CHARACTER_VAPOR_TRAIL_NAME]
雾轨

[zh.CHARACTER_VAPOR_TRAIL_DESC]
前闪电天马学院学员，层云堡的骄傲之一。雾轨生长于一个过度溺爱她的家庭，这导致她决定远离聚光灯，渴望躲藏在大众的视线之外。在闪电天马学院，她一直在帮助好友破空飞行，却从未想过要让自己成为优秀的飞行员。幸运的是，在破空发现真相后，雾轨也终于在暮光闪闪与云宝黛茜的劝说下意识到了自己的潜力。好景不长，闪电天马学院的解散让破空与雾轨回到了老家，他们共同经营着一家小餐馆。破空的经营能力实在一般，因此雾轨又不得不，像以前一样，常常偷偷代替破空招揽顾客、与供应商谈判、策划活动等。
几年前，由于曾经在闪电天马学院的缘故，他们的餐馆愿意接纳“自由层云堡运动”成员，庇护他们躲避帝国的追捕。如今，“自由层云堡运动”取得阶段性胜利，他们的餐馆也称为层云堡居民的重要娱乐场所，生意兴隆。
